{"id":"568502bf56055515","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-endmarked-counter-machine.md","title":"只看零状态、每次加减一的计数器机","display":"df-endmarked-counter-machine — 只看零状态、每次加减一的计数器机","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-endmarked-counter-machine","aliases":["73-df-endmarked-counter-machine"],"display":"df-endmarked-counter-machine — 只看零状态、每次加减一的计数器机","depends_on":["[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","[[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]","[[73-df-finite-path-closure]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§8.5.3–8.5.4, print pp. 358–361; PDF pp. 380–383; explicit normalized formalization","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":8},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-endmarked-counter-machine"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-endmarked-counter-machine</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-endmarked-counter-machine — 只看零状态、每次加减一的计数器机"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"773cae915e5165f3\" href=\"?note=773cae915e5165f3\" title=\"73-df-partial-value-conventions\">73-df-partial-value-conventions</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"25902d0bd75ea963\" href=\"?note=25902d0bd75ea963\" title=\"73-df-finite-path-closure\">73-df-finite-path-closure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§8.5.3–8.5.4, print pp. 358–361; PDF pp. 380–383; explicit normalized formalization"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"8"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 为候选七元组；结构谓词不预设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 有效。</li>\n<li>在配置、转移和语言子句中，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CounterMachine}_{\\Sigma,k}(M)\">\\(\\operatorname{CounterMachine}_{\\Sigma,k}(M)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\$,k,\\delta,q_0,F)\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\$,k,\\delta,q_0,F)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\$\\notin\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\">\\(\\$\\notin\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\)</span>；各分量取该元组的投影。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf c\\in\\mathbb N^k\">\\(\\mathbf c\\in\\mathbb N^k\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\">\\(j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbf2^k\">\\(z:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbf2^k\\)</span> 由下式定义。在一步关系子句中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(q,u,\\mathbf c),(p,v,\\mathbf d)\\in\\operatorname{CConf}_M\">\\((q,u,\\mathbf c),(p,v,\\mathbf d)\\in\\operatorname{CConf}_M\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>有限词、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WordLabel}\">\\(\\operatorname{WordLabel}\\)</span>、部分函数图和有限路径闭包均采用已列依赖。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"z:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbf2^k,\\qquad\nz(\\mathbf c)\\coloneqq\\left\\langle\\begin{cases}0,&amp;c_j=0,\\\\1,&amp;c_j&gt;0\\end{cases}:1\\le j\\le k\\right\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[z:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbf2^k,\\qquad\nz(\\mathbf c)\\coloneqq\\left\\langle\\begin{cases}0,&amp;c_j=0,\\\\1,&amp;c_j&gt;0\\end{cases}:1\\le j\\le k\\right\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{CounterMachine}_{\\Sigma,k}(M)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists Q,q_0,F,\\$\\;\\exists\\delta:(Q\\setminus F)\\times(\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\$,\\varepsilon\\})\\times\\mathbf2^k\n\\rightharpoonup Q\\times\\{-1,0,1\\}^k\\;\\bigl[&amp;\nM=(Q,\\Sigma,\\$,k,\\delta,q_0,F)\\land\\$\\notin\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\land0&lt;|Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land q_0\\in Q\\land F\\subseteq Q\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall q,\\mathbf z\\;((q,\\varepsilon,\\mathbf z)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\delta)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall a\\in\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\$\\}\\;(q,a,\\mathbf z)\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(\\delta))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall((q,a,\\mathbf z),(p,\\mathbf e))\\in\\delta\\;\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;(z_j=0\\Longrightarrow e_j\\ge0)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{CounterMachine}_{\\Sigma,k}(M)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists Q,q_0,F,\\$\\;\\exists\\delta:(Q\\setminus F)\\times(\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\$,\\varepsilon\\})\\times\\mathbf2^k\n\\rightharpoonup Q\\times\\{-1,0,1\\}^k\\;\\bigl[&amp;\nM=(Q,\\Sigma,\\$,k,\\delta,q_0,F)\\land\\$\\notin\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\land0&lt;|Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land q_0\\in Q\\land F\\subseteq Q\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall q,\\mathbf z\\;((q,\\varepsilon,\\mathbf z)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\delta)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall a\\in\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\$\\}\\;(q,a,\\mathbf z)\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(\\delta))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall((q,a,\\mathbf z),(p,\\mathbf e))\\in\\delta\\;\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;(z_j=0\\Longrightarrow e_j\\ge0)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CConf}_M\\coloneqq Q\\times(\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\$\\})^*\\times\\mathbb N^k,\\qquad\n(q,u,\\mathbf c)\\rightsquigarrow_M(p,v,\\mathbf d)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists a\\in\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\$,\\varepsilon\\}\\;\\exists\\mathbf e\\in\\{-1,0,1\\}^k\\;\n[((q,a,z(\\mathbf c)),(p,\\mathbf e))\\in\\delta\\land\nu=\\operatorname{WordLabel}_{\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\$\\}}(a)v\\land\n\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;d_j=c_j+e_j].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CConf}_M\\coloneqq Q\\times(\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\$\\})^*\\times\\mathbb N^k,\\qquad\n(q,u,\\mathbf c)\\rightsquigarrow_M(p,v,\\mathbf d)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists a\\in\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\$,\\varepsilon\\}\\;\\exists\\mathbf e\\in\\{-1,0,1\\}^k\\;\n[((q,a,z(\\mathbf c)),(p,\\mathbf e))\\in\\delta\\land\nu=\\operatorname{WordLabel}_{\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\$\\}}(a)v\\land\n\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;d_j=c_j+e_j].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L_{\\mathsf{ctr}}(M)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{CConf}_M\\;\n[((q_0,w\\langle\\$\\rangle,\\langle0:1\\le j\\le k\\rangle),C)\n\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{CConf}_M}(\\{(D,E):D,E\\in\\operatorname{CConf}_M,\\ D\\rightsquigarrow_ME\\})\n\\land\\pi_1(C)\\in F\\land\\pi_2(C)=\\varepsilon]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L_{\\mathsf{ctr}}(M)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{CConf}_M\\;\n[((q_0,w\\langle\\$\\rangle,\\langle0:1\\le j\\le k\\rangle),C)\n\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{CConf}_M}(\\{(D,E):D,E\\in\\operatorname{CConf}_M,\\ D\\rightsquigarrow_ME\\})\n\\land\\pi_1(C)\\in F\\land\\pi_2(C)=\\varepsilon]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>状态只能看到每个计数器是否为零，不能直接读取它的完整数值。不同计数器可在同一步独立变动一单位；零计数器不可减一。配置关系的载体排除了负数，结构条件也禁止从零执行减法。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-partial-value-conventions","status":"resolved","id":"773cae915e5165f3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-path-closure","status":"resolved","id":"25902d0bd75ea963","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-path-closure]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CounterMachine}_{\\Sigma,k}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\$,k,\\delta,q_0,F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\$\\notin\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf c\\in\\mathbb N^k","display":false},{"tex":"j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"z:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbf2^k","display":false},{"tex":"(q,u,\\mathbf c),(p,v,\\mathbf d)\\in\\operatorname{CConf}_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{WordLabel}","display":false},{"tex":"z:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbf2^k,\\qquad\nz(\\mathbf c)\\coloneqq\\left\\langle\\begin{cases}0,&c_j=0,\\\\1,&c_j>0\\end{cases}:1\\le j\\le k\\right\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{CounterMachine}_{\\Sigma,k}(M)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists Q,q_0,F,\\$\\;\\exists\\delta:(Q\\setminus F)\\times(\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\$,\\varepsilon\\})\\times\\mathbf2^k\n\\rightharpoonup Q\\times\\{-1,0,1\\}^k\\;\\bigl[&\nM=(Q,\\Sigma,\\$,k,\\delta,q_0,F)\\land\\$\\notin\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\land0<|Q|<\\aleph_0\\land q_0\\in Q\\land F\\subseteq Q\\\\\n&\\land\\forall q,\\mathbf z\\;((q,\\varepsilon,\\mathbf z)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\delta)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall a\\in\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\$\\}\\;(q,a,\\mathbf z)\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(\\delta))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall((q,a,\\mathbf z),(p,\\mathbf e))\\in\\delta\\;\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;(z_j=0\\Longrightarrow e_j\\ge0)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CConf}_M\\coloneqq Q\\times(\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\$\\})^*\\times\\mathbb N^k,\\qquad\n(q,u,\\mathbf c)\\rightsquigarrow_M(p,v,\\mathbf d)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists a\\in\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\$,\\varepsilon\\}\\;\\exists\\mathbf e\\in\\{-1,0,1\\}^k\\;\n[((q,a,z(\\mathbf c)),(p,\\mathbf e))\\in\\delta\\land\nu=\\operatorname{WordLabel}_{\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\$\\}}(a)v\\land\n\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;d_j=c_j+e_j].","display":true},{"tex":"L_{\\mathsf{ctr}}(M)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{CConf}_M\\;\n[((q_0,w\\langle\\$\\rangle,\\langle0:1\\le j\\le k\\rangle),C)\n\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{CConf}_M}(\\{(D,E):D,E\\in\\operatorname{CConf}_M,\\ D\\rightsquigarrow_ME\\})\n\\land\\pi_1(C)\\in F\\land\\pi_2(C)=\\varepsilon]\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":3283,"backlinks":[{"id":"34c08ba68aabce9a","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-endmarked-counter-machine]]"},{"id":"6af